# The designed crash (game/breach.h): round 5, ride west into the flicker, mid west wall (+x: on
# your left at the start, facing north). Film it with tests\e2e\film_round.ps1 -Round 5 -Steps
# breach.steps. Termination off (debug camera Z), so a miss only stops the cycle and the shots go
# on: a miss shows the wall; a hit the tear, the corridor through the hole, going down, and the
# skid to a stop on its glass floor.
wait_boot
skip_prologue
press start
press z
press start
wait 0.5
# Left: face west. C x6: cruise 7 -> 13
